1  | ∀x (P(x) → Q(x))
2  | ¬∃x (Q(x) ∧ R(x))
   |----
3  | | ∃x (P(x) ∧ R(x))
   | |----
4  | | | [a] P(a) ∧ R(a)
   | | |----
5  | | | P(a)                     ∧ Elim: 4
6  | | | R(a)                     ∧ Elim: 4
7  | | | P(a) → Q(a)              ∀ Elim: 1
8  | | | Q(a)                     → Elim: 7,5
9  | | | Q(a) ∧ R(a)              ∧ Intro: 8, 6
10 | | | ∃x (Q(x) ∧ R(x))         ∃ Intro: 9
11 | | ∃x (Q(x) ∧ R(x))           ∃ Elim: 3, 4-10
12 | | ⊥                          ⊥ Intro: 11, 2
13 | ¬∃x (P(x) ∧ R(x))            ¬ Intro: 3-12
